		(property "Description" "FC side: VTX link wire pads (SMD 1.5x2.0 on the FC top, facing up to the VTX board; solder wires. Stack 2026-10-19: VTX (top) / ESC / FC (bottom), so the link wires run past the ESC; pad spots to be arranged by hand.). Pinout, 2x5: 1 +3V3, 2 OSD_SCK, 3 OSD_MOSI, 4 OSD_MISO, 5 OSD_CS, 6 VTX_CLK, 7 VTX_DATA, 8 VTX_LE, 9 VTX_PA_EN, 10 5V_EN. No GND pin: Vin/GND (power and signal return) come up the 4 M1.4 screws."
